---
description: Trigger skill-first refactor behavior for legacy JavaFX code
globs:
  - "**/*.java"
alwaysApply: false
---
# Refactor trigger

When a file smells like legacy JavaFX living inside a JRebirth application, restructure it step by step:

- identify which part of the JRebirth role split is missing.
- move the state into the Model.
- move the node creation into the View.
- move the event wiring into the Controller.
- move the actions into a Command or a Service.
- move the cross-feature messaging into the Waves.

Use the legacy refactor skill before you edit many files at once.
